---
import BlockLayout from '../../layouts/BlockLayout.astro';

const title = 'Tone Bloom rings in the tiny web';
const description =
  'Twelve synthesized voices, four speeds, 38 precisely chosen images—and the rare consumer app that knows when to stop.';
const productUrl = 'https://tonebloom.xyz';
const fallbackUrl = 'https://tone-bloom.mhoydich.chatgpt.site';

const reviewJsonLd = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'Review',
  '@id': 'https://pointcast.xyz/reviews/tone-bloom#review',
  url: 'https://pointcast.xyz/reviews/tone-bloom',
  name: title,
  headline: title,
  description,
  datePublished: '2026-07-25',
  inLanguage: 'en-US',
  author: {
    '@type': 'Organization',
    name: 'PointCast Review Lab',
    url: 'https://pointcast.xyz',
  },
  itemReviewed: {
    '@type': 'SoftwareApplication',
    name: 'Tone Bloom',
    url: productUrl,
    applicationCategory: 'LifestyleApplication',
    operatingSystem: 'Web',
    softwareVersion: '0.2',
  },
  reviewRating: {
    '@type': 'Rating',
    ratingValue: 4.5,
    bestRating: 5,
    worstRating: 1,
  },
};
---

<BlockLayout legacy title={title} description={description} image="/images/tone-bloom/tone-bloom-review-og.png">
  <script type="application/ld+json" is:inline set:html={JSON.stringify(reviewJsonLd)} />

  <article class="review">
    <div class="review__bar" aria-label="Review information">
      <a href="/" class="review__brand">POINTCAST</a>
      <a href="/reviews">REVIEWS</a>
      <span>JULY 2026</span>
      <a href="/reviews/tone-bloom.json">JSON ↗</a>
    </div>

    <header class="hero">
      <div class="hero__copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">POCKET SOFTWARE / WEB / FREE</p>
        <h1>TONE<br />BLOOM</h1>
        <p class="hero__dek">{description}</p>
        <div class="hero__actions">
          <a class="button button--primary" href={productUrl}>OPEN TONE BLOOM <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          <a class="button" href="#verdict">SKIP TO VERDICT ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero__score">
        <span class="hero__award">POINTCAST<br />EDITOR'S<br />CHOICE</span>
        <strong>4.5</strong>
        <span>OUT OF 5</span>
        <div class="hero__burst" aria-hidden="true">HOORAY!</div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="lede">
      <p class="drop">
        <span>T</span>one Bloom is a pocket sound garden that feels like software from a better
        1987: enormous type, fearless color, almost no instructions, and one excellent idea.
        Tap a picture. Hear a bell, a bowl, a marimba, a soft electronic spring. Swipe again.
        The whole thing changes before your thumb has time to get bored.
      </p>
      <p>
        It works in the awkward little seams of a day: standing in the grocery line, watching
        the Hudson pass from a train, riding the Surfliner north, or making the final screen
        before bed something gentler than a feed. No account. No streak. No push notification
        asking whether you still care about tranquility.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="specs" aria-label="Tone Bloom key facts">
      <div><strong>12</strong><span>SYNTH VOICES</span></div>
      <div><strong>4</strong><span>PACE MODES</span></div>
      <div><strong>38</strong><span>CORE IMAGES</span></div>
      <div><strong>0</strong><span>ACCOUNTS</span></div>
    </section>

    <figure class="screen screen--desktop">
      <img
        src="/images/tone-bloom/tone-bloom-desktop.jpg"
        width="1280"
        height="800"
        alt="Tone Bloom desktop view showing vivid artwork, listening controls, and the instrument tray"
        loading="eager"
      />
      <figcaption><b>FIG. 1</b> The released web version at full bloom. It is colorful without becoming busy.</figcaption>
    </figure>

    <section class="chapter">
      <div class="chapter__number">01</div>
      <div class="chapter__body">
        <p class="eyebrow">OPEN, TAP, EXHALE</p>
        <h2>THE GOOD KIND OF IMMEDIATE</h2>
        <p>
          Tone Bloom passes the most important consumer-software test in about six seconds:
          you know what it wants from you, and doing it feels good. The image fills the screen.
          The controls stay within one-thumb range. Audio waits for your first touch—as browsers
          sensibly require—and then responds without ceremony.
        </p>
        <p>
          Manual mode turns the library into a tiny instrument. Auto mode becomes a visual
          listening session. Neither mode pretends to be productivity.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="pace-panel">
      <div class="pace-panel__intro">
        <span class="eyebrow">THE SPEED DIAL</span>
        <h2>FOUR WAYS TO LET TIME PASS</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="pace-grid">
        <div><b>FLOAT</b><p>Long, slow intervals. Our before-bed pick.</p></div>
        <div><b>FLOW</b><p>The original easy rhythm for a short train window.</p></div>
        <div><b>QUICK</b><p>Enough motion to reset a grocery-line brain.</p></div>
        <div class="pace-grid__spark"><b>SPARK</b><p>Fast, bright, and almost pop-y. Surprisingly effective.</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="two-up">
      <figure class="screen screen--phone">
        <img
          src="/images/tone-bloom/tone-bloom-mobile-spark.jpg"
          width="390"
          height="844"
          alt="Tone Bloom on a phone in Spark mode with Auto enabled"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <figcaption><b>FIG. 2</b> Spark mode on a 390-pixel mobile viewport. No pinching, panning, or menu archaeology.</figcaption>
      </figure>

      <section class="sound-card">
        <p class="eyebrow">THE SOUND CARD</p>
        <h2>GOOD VIBRATIONS,<br />NO DOWNLOAD</h2>
        <p>
          The 12 voices are synthesized in the browser, which makes Tone Bloom instant and
          light. The meditative side—bell, gong, bowl—lands first. Velvet Vibes and Sunlit
          Marimba soften the middle. Water Drop and Neon Spring give the playful end a welcome
          little snap.
        </p>
        <div class="lab-note">
          <strong>LAB FAVORITES</strong>
          <span>1. Water Drop</span>
          <span>2. Neon Spring</span>
          <span>3. Singing Bowl</span>
        </div>
        <p class="fine">
          Headphones reveal more of the tails and overtones, but they are not required.
          Different browsers and speakers color synthesized audio a little differently.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <section class="archive">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">THE 500-IMAGE QUESTION</p>
        <h2>THE ANSWER ISN'T<br />“SHOW ALL 500”</h2>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p>
          Tone Bloom has access to a huge Midjourney V8.2 image archive. The tempting move
          would be to pour it all into the product. The correct move is the 38-image core:
          small enough to feel authored, large enough to keep returning.
        </p>
        <p>
          A later “Archive Drift” mode could lazily open the deeper collection for longer,
          stranger sessions. For now, curation gives each sound-image pairing a chance to
          become familiar—the beginning of an experience instead of a slideshow.
        </p>
        <p>
          If you want the maximalist art-viewer version of this world, enter
          <a href="https://the-listening-grove.mhoydich.chatgpt.site">The Listening Grove ↗</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="ratings" id="verdict">
      <div class="ratings__title">
        <p class="eyebrow">POINTCAST REVIEW LAB</p>
        <h2>THE VERDICT</h2>
        <div class="score-stamp">4.5<small>/ 5</small></div>
      </div>
      <div class="ratings__bars">
        <div style="--score: 94%"><span>DESIGN</span><i></i><b>9.4</b></div>
        <div style="--score: 88%"><span>SOUND</span><i></i><b>8.8</b></div>
        <div style="--score: 92%"><span>ONE-THUMB USE</span><i></i><b>9.2</b></div>
        <div style="--score: 97%"><span>RESTRAINT</span><i></i><b>9.7</b></div>
        <div style="--score: 91%"><span>REPLAY VALUE</span><i></i><b>9.1</b></div>
      </div>
      <div class="ratings__copy">
        <p>
          <b>PROS:</b> Immediate, beautiful, private, genuinely mobile-first. Four pace modes
          turn one simple interaction into several distinct moods. It gets out of your way.
        </p>
        <p>
          <b>CONS:</b> Browser synthesis cannot match a studio sample library. Haptics await
          a future app version. People who want goals, sharing, or endless settings will find
          almost nothing to optimize.
        </p>
        <p class="verdict-line">
          <b>BOTTOM LINE:</b> Tone Bloom is a rare small web product with a clear emotional
          job—and enough taste to finish the job before becoming a platform.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="review-footer">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">TRY IT NOW</p>
        <a class="review-footer__launch" href={productUrl}>TONEBLOOM.XYZ ↗</a>
        <p class="fallback">
          DNS still waking up? Use the
          <a href={fallbackUrl}>direct Tone Bloom address</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
      <nav aria-label="Related experiences">
        <span>RELATED SIGNALS</span>
        <a href="https://the-listening-grove.mhoydich.chatgpt.site">The Listening Grove ↗</a>
        <a href="https://saturday-july-18-2026.mhoydich.chatgpt.site">Saturday, July 18 ↗</a>
        <a href="https://fifty-from-2025.mhoydich.chatgpt.site">Fifty from 2025 ↗</a>
        <a href="/b/0493">Block № 0493 →</a>
      </nav>
      <p class="credits">
        TONE BLOOM BY MIKE HOYDICH × GPT-5.6 SOL · MIDJOURNEY V8.2 VISUALS<br />
        REVIEW BY CODEX FOR POINTCAST · JULY 25, 2026
      </p>
    </footer>
  </article>
</BlockLayout>

<style>
  :global(body) {
    background: #f4eedf;
  }

  .review {
    --ink: #171525;
    --paper: #f4eedf;
    --blue: #244de8;
    --acid: #e8ff31;
    --coral: #ff5d5a;
    color: var(--ink);
    background:
      linear-gradient(rgba(23, 21, 37, 0.045) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(23, 21, 37, 0.045) 1px, transparent 1px),
      var(--paper);
    background-size: 24px 24px;
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .review__bar {
    min-height: 44px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    padding: 0.65rem clamp(1rem, 4vw, 4rem);
    background: var(--ink);
    color: white;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .review__bar a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
  .review__bar a:last-child { margin-left: auto; }
  .review__brand { color: var(--acid) !important; }

  .hero {
    min-height: 670px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(270px, 32vw);
    border-bottom: 10px solid var(--ink);
  }

  .hero__copy {
    padding: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 6rem);
    align-self: center;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  }

  h1, h2 {
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(5rem, 14vw, 12rem);
    line-height: 0.7;
    letter-spacing: -0.09em;
    color: var(--blue);
    text-shadow: 8px 8px 0 var(--coral);
  }

  .hero__dek {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 5rem) 0 2rem;
    font-family: 'Lora', serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2vw, 1.8rem);
    line-height: 1.35;
  }

  .hero__actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem; }
  .button {
    display: inline-flex;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0.9rem 1rem;
    border: 3px solid var(--ink);
    color: var(--ink);
    background: var(--paper);
    box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 var(--ink);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .button--primary { background: var(--acid); }
  .button:hover { transform: translate(2px, 2px); box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 var(--ink); }

  .hero__score {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 2rem;
    background: var(--blue);
    color: white;
    text-align: center;
    border-left: 10px solid var(--ink);
  }
  .hero__score strong {
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(7rem, 15vw, 13rem);
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--acid);
  }
  .hero__score > span:not(.hero__award) { font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.2em; }
  .hero__award {
    position: absolute;
    top: 2rem;
    right: 2rem;
    padding: 0.75rem;
    background: var(--acid);
    color: var(--ink);
    transform: rotate(4deg);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }
  .hero__burst {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 2rem;
    left: -2.25rem;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 100px;
    height: 100px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--coral);
    border: 4px solid var(--ink);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 700;
    transform: rotate(-12deg);
  }

  .lede {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr;
    gap: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 7rem);
    padding: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 7rem);
    font-family: 'Lora', serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 2vw, 1.7rem);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .lede p { margin: 0; }
  .drop span {
    float: left;
    margin: 0.06em 0.12em 0 0;
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
    font-size: 5.3em;
    line-height: 0.74;
    color: var(--coral);
  }

  .specs {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    border-block: 5px solid var(--ink);
    background: var(--acid);
  }
  .specs div {
    padding: clamp(1rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
    border-right: 3px solid var(--ink);
  }
  .specs div:last-child { border-right: 0; }
  .specs strong {
    display: block;
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 7vw, 6rem);
    line-height: 0.9;
  }
  .specs span { display: block; margin-top: 0.8rem; font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 700; }

  .screen { margin: 0; }
  .screen img { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; }
  .screen figcaption {
    padding: 0.8rem 1rem;
    background: var(--ink);
    color: white;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .screen figcaption b { color: var(--acid); }

  .chapter {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(130px, 25vw) 1fr;
    border-bottom: 5px solid var(--ink);
  }
  .chapter__number {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    min-height: 520px;
    background: var(--coral);
    border-right: 5px solid var(--ink);
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(7rem, 18vw, 16rem);
    line-height: 0.8;
    writing-mode: vertical-rl;
  }
  .chapter__body { padding: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 8rem); }
  h2 {
    margin: 0 0 2rem;
    font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 7vw, 7rem);
    line-height: 0.87;
    letter-spacing: -0.06em;
  }
  .chapter__body > p:not(.eyebrow),
  .archive p,
  .sound-card > p:not(.eyebrow),
  .ratings__copy p {
    max-width: 830px;
    font-family: 'Lora', serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.7vw, 1.4rem);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .pace-panel {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.85fr 1.15fr;
    background: var(--blue);
    color: white;
    border-bottom: 8px solid var(--ink);
  }
  .pace-panel__intro { padding: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 6rem); }
  .pace-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  .pace-grid div {
    min-height: 240px;
    padding: 2rem;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--ink);
    border-bottom: 3px solid var(--ink);
  }
  .pace-grid div:nth-last-child(-n + 2) { border-bottom: 0; }
  .pace-grid b { font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif; font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 4rem); }
  .pace-grid p { line-height: 1.6; }
  .pace-grid__spark { background: var(--acid); color: var(--ink); }

  .two-up {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(300px, 0.8fr) 1.2fr;
    border-bottom: 8px solid var(--ink);
  }
  .screen--phone {
    padding: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 6rem);
    background: var(--coral);
    border-right: 8px solid var(--ink);
  }
  .screen--phone img {
    max-width: 390px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    border: 5px solid var(--ink);
    box-shadow: 16px 16px 0 var(--ink);
  }
  .screen--phone figcaption {
    max-width: 390px;
    margin: 1rem auto 0;
  }
  .sound-card { padding: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 7rem); align-self: center; }
  .lab-note {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    max-width: 430px;
    margin: 2rem 0;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background: var(--acid);
    border: 3px solid var(--ink);
    box-shadow: 7px 7px 0 var(--ink);
  }
  .lab-note strong { border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ink); padding-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .fine { font-size: 0.85rem !important; }

  .archive {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 7rem);
    padding: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 7rem);
    background: var(--acid);
    border-bottom: 8px solid var(--ink);
  }
  .archive a { color: var(--blue); font-weight: 700; }

  .ratings {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.8fr 1.2fr;
    background: white;
  }
  .ratings__title {
    position: relative;
    padding: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 6rem);
    background: var(--ink);
    color: white;
  }
  .score-stamp {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    padding: 1rem;
    background: var(--coral);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 9rem);
    line-height: 0.8;
    transform: rotate(-3deg);
  }
  .score-stamp small { font-size: 1rem; }
  .ratings__bars { padding: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 6rem); }
  .ratings__bars div {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(115px, 0.45fr) 1fr 2.5rem;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 1.7rem;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .ratings__bars i {
    height: 16px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--blue) var(--score), #d9d5ca var(--score));
    border: 2px solid var(--ink);
  }
  .ratings__copy {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 2rem;
    padding: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 6rem);
    border-top: 5px solid var(--ink);
  }
  .ratings__copy p { margin: 0; }
  .verdict-line {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background: var(--acid);
    border: 3px solid var(--ink);
  }

  .review-footer {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
    gap: 3rem;
    padding: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 7rem);
    background: var(--blue);
    color: white;
  }
  .review-footer__launch {
    color: var(--acid);
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 6rem);
    line-height: 0.9;
    text-decoration: none;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  .review-footer .fallback { font-size: 0.75rem; }
  .review-footer a { color: var(--acid); }
  .review-footer nav { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.9rem; }
  .review-footer nav span { font-weight: 700; color: var(--acid); }
  .credits {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    margin: 2rem 0 0;
    padding-top: 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.4);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .review__bar { gap: 0.7rem; font-size: 0.57rem; }
    .review__bar span:nth-child(3) { display: none; }
    .hero { min-height: auto; grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .hero__copy { padding: 3rem 1rem 2.5rem; }
    h1 { font-size: clamp(4.6rem, 27vw, 7rem); text-shadow: 5px 5px 0 var(--coral); }
    .hero__score { min-height: 270px; border-left: 0; border-top: 8px solid var(--ink); }
    .hero__score strong { font-size: 8rem; }
    .hero__burst { left: 1rem; bottom: -2rem; width: 78px; height: 78px; font-size: 0.75rem; }
    .lede, .archive { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding: 4rem 1.25rem; }
    .specs { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    .specs div { border-bottom: 3px solid var(--ink); }
    .specs div:nth-child(2) { border-right: 0; }
    .specs div:nth-last-child(-n + 2) { border-bottom: 0; }
    .chapter { grid-template-columns: 76px 1fr; }
    .chapter__number { min-height: 460px; font-size: 5.5rem; }
    .chapter__body { padding: 3rem 1.2rem; }
    .pace-panel, .two-up, .ratings, .review-footer { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .pace-panel__intro { padding: 3rem 1.2rem; }
    .pace-grid { border-top: 5px solid var(--ink); }
    .pace-grid div { min-height: 190px; padding: 1.25rem; }
    .screen--phone { border-right: 0; border-bottom: 8px solid var(--ink); padding: 3rem 1.2rem; }
    .screen--phone img { max-width: 330px; box-shadow: 9px 9px 0 var(--ink); }
    .sound-card { padding: 4rem 1.2rem; }
    .ratings__title, .ratings__bars { padding: 4rem 1.2rem; }
    .ratings__copy { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding: 3rem 1.2rem; }
    .verdict-line { grid-column: auto; }
    .review-footer { padding: 4rem 1.2rem; }
    .credits { grid-column: auto; }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .button:hover { transform: none; }
  }
</style>
